  <path d="M3 12h1m8 -9v1m8 8h1m-15.4 -6.4l.7 .7m12.1 -.7l-.7 .7" />
  <path d="M9 16a5 5 0 1 1 6 0a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 -1 3a2 2 0 0 1 -4 0a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 -1 -3" />
  <path d="M9.7 17l4.6 0" /></svg><span class="door__intent" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Understand</span></span> <span class="door__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>What Engineers Are Judged On</span> <span class="door__sub" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Now AI agents write much of the code, so an engineer is judged on the setup the engineer builds.</span> </a><a class="door" style="--dc:var(--i-apply)" href="/wiki/Systems/AI--and--Agentic-Systems/Vibe-Coding/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="door__kind" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="kb-icon" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-patnjmll><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" />
  <path d="M6 6a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-8a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2l0 -4" />
  <path d="M12 2v2" />
  <path d="M9 12v9" />
  <path d="M15 12v9" />
  <path d="M5 16l4 -2" />
  <path d="M15 14l4 2" />
  <path d="M9 18h6" />
  <path d="M10 8v.01" />
  <path d="M14 8v.01" /></svg><span class="door__intent" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Apply</span></span> <span class="door__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Vibe Coding</span> <span class="door__sub" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>You ask an AI agent for an app in everyday language, and the agent writes the code and runs it. Soon all coding will become vibe coding.</span> </a><a class="door" style="--dc:var(--i-learn)" href="/wiki/Syntheses/Are-You-Learning,-or-Just-Using-Techniques/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="door__kind" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="kb-icon" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-patnjmll><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" />
  <path d="M22 9l-10 -4l-10 4l10 4l10 -4v6" />
  <path d="M6 10.6v5.4a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-5.4" /></svg><span class="door__intent" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Learn</span></span> <span class="door__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Does a Study Technique Work?</span> <span class="door__sub" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>A technique such as notes or a mind map works only if it makes you process the material in your mind.</span> </a><a class="door" style="--dc:var(--i-decode)" href="/wiki/Language/Chinese/How-Chinese-Characters-Work/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="door__kind" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="kb-icon" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-patnjmll><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" />
  <path d="M9 6.371c0 4.418 -2.239 6.629 -5 6.629" />
  <path d="M4 6.371h7" />
  <path d="M5 9c0 2.144 2.252 3.908 6 4" />
  <path d="M12 20l4 -9l4 9" />
  <path d="M19.1 18h-6.2" />
  <path d="M6.694 3l.793 .582" /></svg><span class="door__intent" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Decode</span></span> <span class="door__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>How Chinese Characters Are Built</span> <span class="door__sub" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Each character is made of smaller parts, and each part has a different function.</span> </a><a class="door" style="--dc:var(--i-explore)" href="/map/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="door__kind" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="kb-icon" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex-shrink:0" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-patnjmll><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" />
  <path d="M5.931 6.936l1.275 4.249m5.607 5.609l4.251 1.275" />
  <path d="M11.683 12.317l5.759 -5.759" />
  <path d="M4 5.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 3 0a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 -3 0" />
  <path d="M17 5.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 3 0a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 -3 0" />
  <path d="M17 18.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 3 0a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 -3 0" />
  <path d="M4 15.5a4.5 4.5 0 1 0 9 0a4.5 4.5 0 1 0 -9 0" /></svg><span class="door__intent" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Explore</span></span> <span class="door__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Map of the Site</span> <span class="door__sub" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Every node is an article on the site, and a line between two nodes shows a relationship.</span> </a> </div> </section> <section class="topmind" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="topmind__head" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Top of mind</h2> <ul class="topmind__list" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <li class="topmind__item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="topmind__q" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>How do you build trust with your agents?</p> <p class="topmind__links" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><a href="/wiki/Systems/Agentic-Workflows/Poteto-Paved-Path/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Poteto Paved Path</a></span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> · <a href="/wiki/Systems/Agentic-Workflows/Karpathy-LLM-Wiki/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Karpathy LLM-Wiki</a></span> </p> </li><li class="topmind__item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="topmind__q" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Arcs give a character a moral core first. Later arcs charge the moral core against something the character loves. Do stories people love work that way?</p> <p class="topmind__links" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><a href="/wiki/Tsumugu/Tsumugu/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Tsumugu</a></span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> · <a href="/wiki/Story-Craft/The-Moral-Core/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>The Moral Core</a></span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> · <a href="/wiki/Story-Craft/Arc-Types/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Arc Types</a></span> </p> </li><li class="topmind__item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="topmind__q" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Exercise, clothing, and travel pages, written with my personal taste in mind</p> <p class="topmind__links" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><a href="/wiki/Fitness/Movement-as-Accretion/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Movement as Accretion</a></span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> · <a href="/wiki/Fashion/The-Personal-Uniform/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>The Personal Uniform</a></span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> · <a href="/wiki/Travel/Warm-Countries,-Cold-Countries/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Warm Countries, Cold Countries</a></span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> · <a href="/wiki/Travel/Reading-as-Local/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Reading as Local</a></span> </p> </li><li class="topmind__item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="topmind__q" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>How do you check a personal belief? These pages follow the logic of a political opinion, and its second-order effects.</p> <p class="topmind__links" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><a href="/wiki/Worldviews--and--the-Political-Order/Worldviews--and--the-Political-Order/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Worldviews &amp; the Political Order</a></span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> · <a href="/wiki/Worldviews--and--the-Political-Order/Validity-and-Truth/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Validity and Truth</a></span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> · <a href="/personal/2026-08-17-positions/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Positions</a></span> </p> </li> </ul> </section> <section class="hub-lists" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="hub-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="hub-card__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Five Dimensions</div> <ul class="hub-list" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/wiki/Dimensions/Deep-Processing/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="kb-icon hub-list__icon" style="width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--d-learning)" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-patnjmll><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" />
