  <path d="M21 12l-3 -6l-3 6a3 3 0 0 0 6 0" /></svg> <span class="hub-list__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Worldviews</span> <span class="hub-list__count" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>35</span> </a> </li> </ul> </div> </section> <section class="updates" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="updates__head" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Project Updates</h2> <div class="updates__box" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="updates__day" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="updates__date" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>2026-09-22</div> <ul class="updates__list" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <li class="updates__item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a class="updates__title" href="/wiki/Systems/Agentic-Workflows/Poteto-Paved-Path/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Poteto Paved Path</a> <p class="updates__blurb" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>An agent copies a shortcut left in a file. A correction of the shortcut goes into the file, or into a check that fails a build, before the next agent extends the shortcut.</p> </li><li class="updates__item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a class="updates__title" href="/wiki/Systems/Agentic-Workflows/Karpathy-LLM-Wiki/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Karpathy LLM-Wiki</a> <p class="updates__blurb" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>A question against a pile of files makes a model search the pile again and save nothing. The model then writes each source into pages, and the next question starts from the pages.</p> </li> </ul> </div><div class="updates__day" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="updates__date" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>2026-09-16</div> <ul class="updates__list" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <li class="updates__item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a class="updates__title" href="/wiki/Argument-Validation/Argument-Validation/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Argument Validation</a> <p class="updates__blurb" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Valid means a conclusion follows from facts an argument states. Sound means the conclusion follows and the facts are true. Each test works on any argument.</p> </li><li class="updates__item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a class="updates__title" href="/wiki/Worldviews--and--the-Political-Order/East-Asian-Exams---The-Arms-Race/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>East Asian Exams - The Arms Race</a> <p class="updates__blurb" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>One exam at about age 18 ranks students against each other for university. A student&#39;s rank on the exam still sets pay decades later. Tutoring by one family forces tutoring by the rest.</p> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </section> </div> </main>  <footer class="kb-footer" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte>  </footer>  <script>
      (function () {
        var btn = document.getElementById('theme-toggle');
        if (!btn) return;
        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          var html = document.documentElement;
          var next =
            html.getAttribute('data-theme') === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';
          html.setAttribute('data-theme', next);
          try {
            localStorage.setItem('theme', next);
          } catch (e) {}
        });
      })();
    </script>  <script type="module" src="/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Dcq8rnIX.js"></script> </body> </html>